---
/**
 * Puts two code blocks next to each other: the C# you know on the left, the same thing in Python on the right.
 * On a narrow screen the second block moves under the first.
 *
 * Give each block a `title`, and keep the lines under about 38 characters so neither side needs to scroll.
 */
---

<div class="hf-compare not-content">
	<div class="hf-compare__grid"><slot /></div>
</div>
